# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local working material: source documents, archives and design references.
# Deliberately untracked. GitHub Pages serves this repository from its root,
# so anything committed here is downloadable from the live domain by anyone
# who guesses the path. Contracts, agreements and internal plans stay local.
working-files/

# Video masters and cuts. GitHub hard-rejects any file over 100 MB, so a
# committed recording does not just bloat the repo, it blocks the push that
# carries everything else. The workshop video is hosted off-repo and pointed
# at from uk-workshop/video.js. Keep local copies here freely; none ship.
*.mp4
*.mov
